{
  "id": "JDG.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Fuga Laja Girgweaguutka 19",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida Lawi ea gwealleadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eawoojigiga, damanda manda sugoocheanda heeda fuga Israeli, abeeda gwanda siyagi bea Lawi, nea goopteada nea rabascheanda aba madeeda ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, ak ghaghi gwealleeda aba Betlehemeeda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwealeedida itaanyiini gwahiseada, ak ghang'eat gawa gheeh ghwaan was Betlehemeeda Yuda, ak goobiida hoowa sheeh ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ghwaat geeshta siyeadaanyi goobalool biiknoodeaba ghoah, nea niny abeeda gwandeawa siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, ea digeen iyeenya; hean ghwadeapta gatmoodida ak ghwanung' gawa jeeda gheanyaawa ak ghwadaah ghwaan gahoosan aba deaktaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gweargweeda agweaji, was ghweanda gatmoodida, ghoadeal, ak gwandeayi eawooji samwagu; hean gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi ak gwalla hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu eaweeteaba ang'wan, ghang'eat ng'eat sakteayda duu, ak ghang'eat gawa; ak ghweanda gatmoodida gwayeesha siida agweaji, “Ahang'waanya gurooroadaang'u, ak ginyooh aga hamidi mwanang', ak iidu gajaweayeena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobiitpiit, ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi iyeenyeeda nyaawa, ng'ata gwayeesha ghweanda gatmooda siidida, “Mwasa, geamuscheey, amuuchuuni, nea ginung' gahoosan gurooroadaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat siidida gagasa gawa, hean ghwasapsap gweargweeda agweaji, ea ghamwas ruweangeaba hoowa gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghang'eat sakteayda duu eaweedeaba muut ak gagasa gawa, ng'ata gwayeesha ghweanda gatmooda, “Ahang'waanya gurooroadaang'u, geamuscheey apteada ea gamikta aseeta.” Hean gweagiischi iyeenye nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat siidida, sea gwealleadaanyi ea siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, hean gwayeesha ghweanda gatmoadaanyi, “Ng'ula nimikta aseeta, geamuscheey abiidana hiji ea gamuchu, ng'ula niriikghta gwaduulean askwearjeanda, lilana hiji, gahoosan gurooroadaang'u; ak abeeda ging'eadi una numuji sakteayda duw, ak guwi ghaheang'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaheawa siida goobiida hoowa eaweedida, hean ghang'eat ak gawa, ea ghwahita murdeeda Yebusi (nih hean Yerusalemu gil); nea abeeda gwandeayi sea digeen iyeenya sareeshi sea gwealeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwaneekiisa Yebusi, abeeda ea niriikghta goosha askwearjeanda; gwayeesha siida gadiyeeda siidaanyi haw, “Asi eayamwa geat ak geeweayi jeeda mujiineani bea fuga Yebusiin eelana jeeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha siidaanyi haw, “Aseasa majeayamwa geat ak geeweayi jeeda mujiineeda rabasta, mawoosa diibiga Israeli, hean gajeang'ata ea eahita Gibea.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, “Asi eahita jeedeaba mujiineanagi, ak gajeelana Gibea ghana Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waayi naweeda gaweay mwadi, hean gamikta aseeta ak gwaneekiisa Gibea, was mujiineeda Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayamsa geat hoowa, gwalla Gibea; hean gawa jeeda ak goopteada aba gheata naweeda bea mujiini, aba gideaba manda siisi deapta gaweay gwalla gheanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, ghwahidu gweargweeni waas, nea gwaleabu gadiyeeda aba madamnyeandaanyi, nea siisi gaba ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, nea abeeda niny goobiita Gibea nea ea rabascheanda nea fuga bea ng'eanyiida ea fuga Benjamini gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagatkat gheanyangaaschi, ghwadaah siidida was bareanoocheandean aba ghuuta naweeda bea mujiini; ng'ata goobearsa gweargweedida, “Ang'iing'i gigali yeenu? Nea gileabu yeenu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Aseasa geesikchi hiji nea geeleabu Betlehemeeda Yuda; nea gajeeweaya meatkweeda sheagi bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, nih heeda ealeabu gil nea nealeabu Betlehemeeda Yuda, ak ghamneawa aniini geaweesi gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea manda siisi deaptanaani ghwaadan gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa aseasa nyeega geendeawi, ea hamita digeenigaasa; eara mukaate geendeawi ea difaayi geendeawi gea beacheeweasa aniini ea gatmooni itaang'u bea gadiyeedeani, ea orjeeda mideayi sea aseaseeda was fugaagu bea gadiyeeda; manda gida shoada aba heedeanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha gweargweeda, “Gagasa bea hoyyoo, ak gishoadeaweeyi gaydarata aniini, nea gida sawana ea gideaba adiidu gili naweeda gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat jeedeaba gheanyi, ak ghoadaw digeeniga gichea ghwaak; ng'ata goohuun geeshanga nyaawa, ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda gudu goohoosan gurooruunatka nyaawa, ging'ulayi, fuga mujiineedida, fuga munyasi ak gwaneaweesa gheeda meatkwajeega sean, ak gwayi buuneeda; ak goobalool gweargweeda bea gheeda, ak gwayeesha, “Aruuni jarooda siida hidu gheang'u, geegasayi eanala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarita jarooda siida bea gheeda ak gwayeesha, “Manda fugeasu, geamuscheegwa adiidu goosinyi munyinda haw ea gwasunu, aba gideaba siisi nihidu jeedeaba gheanyu, adiidu goosinyi leendeeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, hudeanyu gwanda hiji, nea ea miyeasat, ea gwealeedeaba siisi, gaydearuudu jarooda, ak ghoayaachi ak goosimi gidoadaayi gideaba ghwadoabiiw aba heedeang'wa, nea siisi ea adiidu goosimi ng'asheanda muy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaheawa fugigeanji gooleeysiit, hean gageanu siidida, ak ghoang'waay gwealeadaanyi, ak gooruuta jarooda heeda mida saawa; ak hean gwaluudayi, ak gwasima gida muy eaweeda sean ea gamuchu, ghaghar gayeew gwasiksa gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu sakteayda duu gatmoodida, ak goobeedeaysa ghuuta gheeda siida mida jeeda siyeadaanyi, bwak ea gamuchu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
